<title>HONG KONG: HK auction - Ho Man Tin site sells for HK$1.4 bln.</title>
<headline>HK auction - Ho Man Tin site sells for HK$1.4 bln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 2,627 sq m site in the Ho Man Tin district of central Kowloon sold for HK$1.4 billion at a Hong Kong government land auction on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Industry analysts had forecast the plot would realise HK$848 million to HK$1.27 billion.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6352</p>
</text>
